<div class="wk-container">
  <div class="wk-header">
    <h1>// account_deletion_scheduled()</h1>
    <h2>Your Wokku account is scheduled for deletion.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="wk-body">
    <div class="wk-alert wk-alert-danger">
      All of your apps, databases, and data will be <strong>permanently deleted on <%= @grace_until %></strong>.
    </div>

    <% if @apps.any? %>
      <div class="wk-label">// apps_to_be_deleted()</div>
      <ul class="wk-list">
        <% @apps.each do |app| %>
          <li><%= app.name %></li>
        <% end %>
      </ul>
    <% end %>

    <% if @databases.any? %>
      <div class="wk-label">// databases_to_be_deleted()</div>
      <ul class="wk-list">
        <% @databases.each do |db| %>
          <li><%= db.name %> (<%= db.service_type %>)</li>
        <% end %>
      </ul>
    <% end %>

    <p>If this was a mistake, reply to this email or contact <a href="mailto:<%= Wokku.support_email %>"><%= Wokku.support_email %></a> before the deadline and we'll cancel the deletion.</p>

    <hr class="wk-divider">

    <a href="mailto:<%= Wokku.support_email %>" class="wk-cta" style="background: #E5484D;">Contact support to cancel →</a>
  </div>
  <div class="wk-footer">
    Wokku<%= " · Invoice-based billing · jakarta, id" if Wokku.cloud? %>
  </div>
</div>
